      "_comment_a7": "`.bfields-dim__link` (28x28, the Style frame's chain beside Width and Height) was removed on 30 Sep 2026 by product decision F3: a single-axis dimensions field has nothing to link, so the button is no longer drawn, and every dimensions field on this screen is single-axis. The compact size stays in admin.css for a two-axis field in the editor.",
      "_comment_repeater": "Repeater (ui/fields/Repeater.tsx, B1, 30 Sep 2026): no Figma frame exists, so these are the designed values from DESIGN-PRINCIPLES.md, not measurements. Only the empty state renders on an untouched demo screen (the Hotspots tab's single-model list); the row card is covered by tests/ts/repeater.test.ts and the standalone Playwright check in the stream-A2 report.",
      "_comment_a8": "Spacing (ui/fields/Spacing.tsx, stream A8, 30 Sep 2026): no Figma frame; the designed Add New compact values (the NumberInput box at 30px, slate hairline) from DESIGN-PRINCIPLES.md, measured on the demo's Padding field (Style tab). The device switch, colour panel, source select and checklist render on no untouched demo tab of both the live and static screens, so they are covered by jest and the A8 Playwright run instead."
