  "_comment_slice2": "Number, code, fieldset and row media (ui/fields/NumberInput.tsx, Code.tsx, Fieldset.tsx, MediaInline.tsx; stream A5, 30 Sep 2026): no Figma frame exists, so these are the designed values from DESIGN-PRINCIPLES.md, not measurements. `.bfields-code__input` is the fallback textarea; in wp-admin core CodeMirror hides it, and its computed values are still the contract. The textarea and the attachment (`media`) row control render on no untouched demo tab; tests/ts/fields-slice2.test.ts and the stream-A5 Playwright check cover them."
